entries[274273] = { ["name"] = "Flask of Natural Accuracy", ["text"] = "Requires Level 55\n\nUse: Increases your Stamina by 60. While in Mount Hyjal, Hyjal Summit, and the Barrow Deeps, you also gain 5% Hit Chance.\n\nLasts for 2 hrs. You can only have the effect of one flask at a time. This effect persists through death. (3 Sec Cooldown)\nSell Price:" }
